    "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">EIC301 · Assessment 2/6</span>\n<h2>Assignment</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Source: FLM syllabus 12834 · assessment table (verbatim)</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">EIC301 · Đầu điểm 2/6</span>\n<h2>Assignment</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Nguồn: syllabus FLM 12834 · bảng đánh giá (nguyên văn)</p></div>\n<div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Type / Loại</span><span class=\"v\">on-going</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Weight / Trọng số</span><span class=\"v\">15.0%</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Parts / Số phần</span><span class=\"v\">1</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Completion criteria / Điều kiện hoàn thành</span><span class=\"v\">&gt;0</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Duration / Thời lượng</span><span class=\"v\">40'</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">CLO</span><span class=\"v\">CLO4</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Question type / Dạng câu hỏi</span><span class=\"v\">Groupwork</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">No. of questions / Số câu</span><span class=\"v\">N/A</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Knowledge &amp; skill / Kiến thức &amp; kỹ năng</span><span class=\"v\">Chapter 12</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Grading guide / Hướng dẫn chấm</span><span class=\"v\">Suggested Assignment Activity:<br>Students work (in class) in groups of 3-4 to come up with an 'advice column' to Vietnamese students who are due to study abroad in a country of their choice. The column will offer suggestions on how to mitigate culture shock and improve cultural adaptation.<br><br>Instructor may choose to ask students to present the work in written format for marking, or to present it verbally in class.</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Note / Ghi chú</span><span class=\"v\">As above.</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Sessions in the plan that mention it</h3>\n<ul><li>Session 16 — Assignment 1</li><li>Session 17 — Assignment 1</li><li>Session 18 — Assignment 1</li><li>Session 49 — Assignment 2</li></ul></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Buổi trong kế hoạch có nhắc tới</h3>\n<ul><li>Buổi 16 — Assignment 1</li><li>Buổi 17 — Assignment 1</li><li>Buổi 18 — Assignment 1</li><li>Buổi 49 — Assignment 2</li></ul></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><p class=\"ghi-chu\">No practice paper for this subject in the Exam Room yet.</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><p class=\"ghi-chu\">Phòng thi chưa có đề luyện cho môn này.</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Exam-strategy notes and worked past papers: coming later.</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Chiến lược làm bài và chữa đề: sẽ bổ sung sau.</div></div>"
